### Teste da Rota Raíz
GET http://localhost:3000/
Content-Type: application/json

### 1. Cadastrar Cliente 
POST http://localhost:3000/cliente
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Carlos",
  "email": "carlos@gmail.com",
  "senha": "abc",
  "cpf": "12345678901",
  "telefone": "47999123456"
}

