### 4. Testar login
# @name loginReq
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "carlos@gmail.com",
  "senha": "abc"
}

### 5. Listar Clientes
GET http://localhost:3000/clientes
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 5. Consultar Cliente
GET http://localhost:3000/cliente/1
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 6. Atualizar cliente
PUT http://localhost:3000/cliente/1
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Carlos Atualizado",
  "email": "carlos@gmail.com",
  "senha": "abc",
  "cpf": "12345678901",
  "telefone": "47999123456"
}

### 7. Excluir Cliente
DELETE  http://localhost:3000/cliente/1
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json



